{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.ParticleInteractions.neutron_qvalue_symbolic","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.neutron_qvalue_symbolic","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.FieldSimp","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Positivity","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Linarith"],"declarations":18,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.neutron_qvalue_symbolic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.neutron_qvalue_symbolic","kind":"theorem","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/neutron_qvalue_symbolic.lean#L88-L112","doc":"**Symbolic `Q`-value closed form (conditional on `conj:borromean-quark`).**\n\nGiven the conjectural NF nets and the energy-scale ansatz, the neutron\n`β⁻`-decay `Q`-value has the closed form\n\n  Q_β = m_e · (2 − h) · h / (2 q (q − 1)),     h = q − q⁻¹.\n\nThe proof *derives* this from `qvalue_ansatz` by substituting the NF nets\n(via `neutron_delta_net`) and clearing the denominator — it is NOT a\nread-back of a stored conclusion. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:neutron-qvalue-symbolic","label":"prop:neutron-qvalue-symbolic","md":"quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/neutron-qvalue-symbolic.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.neutron_delta_net","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.neutron_delta_net","kind":"theorem","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/neutron_qvalue_symbolic.lean#L80-L86","doc":"**Symbolic `Δ(net)` (derived).**  The NF difference\n`net(n) − net(p) = (h² − 2h)/2` follows from the conjectural single-wrap\nNF nets by ring algebra — not a projection of a class field. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.borromeanQuark_denom_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.borromeanQuark_denom_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/neutron_qvalue_symbolic.lean#L71-L78","doc":"Auxiliary positivity: under `1 < q`, the denominator `q(q−1) ≠ 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanQuark.qvalue_ansatz","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanQuark.qvalue_ansatz","kind":"theorem","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/neutron_qvalue_symbolic.lean#L69-L69","doc":"Ansatz input (iii): the `Q`-value is the **absolute** NF difference\n`|Δ(net)|` scaled by the energy scale `E₀ = m_e / (q(q−1))`. This\n`Q_β = |Δ(net)| · E₀` relation is stated \"by construction\" in the\nmanuscript, not derived from the per-braid mass formula. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanQuark.neutron_net","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanQuark.neutron_net","kind":"theorem","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/neutron_qvalue_symbolic.lean#L64-L64","doc":"Conjectural input (ii): neutron NF net `= 1 − 3h/2 + h²/2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanQuark.proton_net","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanQuark.proton_net","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/neutron_qvalue_symbolic.lean#L62-L62","doc":"Conjectural input (i): proton NF net `= 1 − h/2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanQuark.h_lt_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanQuark.h_lt_two","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/neutron_qvalue_symbolic.lean#L60-L60","doc":"Substrate-regime bound: `h < 2`. Holds at `q₀ ≈ 1.11`; needed to\nresolve the absolute value `|h² − 2h| = 2h − h²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanQuark.h_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanQuark.h_pos","kind":"theorem","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/neutron_qvalue_symbolic.lean#L57-L57","doc":"Substrate-regime bound on the Hecke differential: `0 < h`. Holds at\nthe substrate `q₀ ≈ 1.11` (`h ≈ 0.21`); carried as an explicit input\nso the `|Δ(net)|` resolution is rigorous, not assumed silently. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanQuark.Q_β","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanQuark.Q_β","kind":"def","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/neutron_qvalue_symbolic.lean#L53-L53","doc":"The Q-value `Q_β : ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanQuark.net_n","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanQuark.net_n","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/neutron_qvalue_symbolic.lean#L51-L51","doc":"Neutron single-wrap NF net coefficient. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanQuark.net_p","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanQuark.net_p","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/neutron_qvalue_symbolic.lean#L49-L49","doc":"Proton single-wrap NF net coefficient. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanQuark.m_e","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanQuark.m_e","kind":"def","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/neutron_qvalue_symbolic.lean#L47-L47","doc":"Electron mass `m_e : ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanQuark.h_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanQuark.h_eq","kind":"theorem","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/neutron_qvalue_symbolic.lean#L45-L45","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanQuark.h","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanQuark.h","kind":"def","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/neutron_qvalue_symbolic.lean#L44-L44","doc":"Hecke differential `h = q − q⁻¹`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanQuark.q_gt_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanQuark.q_gt_one","kind":"theorem","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/neutron_qvalue_symbolic.lean#L42-L42","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanQuark.q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanQuark.q","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/neutron_qvalue_symbolic.lean#L41-L41","doc":"Substrate parameter `q : ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanQuark.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanQuark.mk","kind":"ctor","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/neutron_qvalue_symbolic.lean#L39-L39","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanQuark","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BorromeanQuark","kind":"class","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/neutron_qvalue_symbolic.lean#L34-L69","doc":"§3b-cond conjecture class for `conj:borromean-quark` (non-degenerate per\nAGENTS.md §3b-cond item 5): carries the conjectural categorical *inputs*\n— the single-wrap NF net coefficients and the energy-scale ansatz — as\nhypotheses, NOT the conclusion (`Δ(net)` and the `Q`-value are derived\nfrom them below). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:borromean-quark","label":"conj:borromean-quark","md":"quantum-observable-universe/observations/borromean-quark.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}